	(1,'2168018','https://www.utahrealestate.com/2168018','87 W Vine St',NULL,'Grantsville','UT','84029',NULL,40.5939760,-112.4665587,'exact',499900,0,NULL,2665,5,3.0,3014,'{\"Floor 1\":1507,\"Basement 1\":1507}',0.2600,2,98,'Single Family','Rambler/Ranch',NULL,2010,'ACCEPTING BACKUP OFFERS',67,0,NULL,NULL,'Nice rambler located in a great area w/5 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, granite countertops and subway tile backsplash, hardwood floors, banister, finished basement w/open family room/rec room area and a gas fireplace entertainment wall, cold storage, big backyard, covered patio. Come take a look!!','[\"Closet: Walk-In\", \"Dishwasher, Built-In\", \"Disposal\", \"Gas Log\", \"Range/Oven: Free Stdng.\", \"Granite Countertops\", \"Floor Coverings: Carpet; Hardwood; Tile\", \"Air Conditioning: Central Air; Electric\", \"Heating: Gas: Central\", \"Basement: (98% finished) Full\"]','[\"Exterior: Double Pane Windows; Patio: Covered\", \"Lot: Curb & Gutter; Fenced: Part; Road: Paved; Sidewalks; Terrain, Flat; View: Mountain\", \"Landscape: Landscaping: Full\", \"Roof: Asphalt Shingles\", \"Exterior: Aluminum; Stone; Vinyl\", \"Patio/Deck: 1 Patio\", \"Garage/Parking: Attached\", \"Garage Capacity: 2\"]','[\"Amenities: Cable TV Available; Electric Dryer Hookup\", \"Utilities: Gas: Connected; Power: Connected; Sewer: Connected; Water: Connected\", \"Water: Culinary\"]','{\"Elementary School\":\"Grantsville\",\"Middle School\":\"Grantsville\",\"High School\":\"Grantsville\",\"School District\":\"Tooele\"}','Brandon S Murray','435-830-2173','Realtypath LLC (Tooele Valley) 500 E Village Blvd Suite 108 Tooele, UT 84074','https://assets.utahrealestate.com/photos/640x480/2168018_e172b9876369bd43ac3c0bb9f669899c_6a3dcce745dd3.jpg',31,'{\"facts\": {\"MLS#\": \"2168018\", \"Type\": \"Single Family\", \"Style\": \"Rambler/Ranch\", \"Status\": \"ACCEPTING BACKUP OFFERS\", \"Year Built\": \"2010\", \"Days on URE\": \"67\"}, \"sizes\": {\"total\": 3014, \"levels\": {\"Floor 1\": 1507, \"Basement 1\": 1507}}, \"widget\": {\"hoa\": \"0\", \"pid\": \"53124\", \"zip\": \"84029\", \"beds\": \"3.00\", \"city\": \"Grantsville\", \"baths\": \"5\", \"price\": \"499900\", \"state\": \"UT\", \"locale\": \"US\", \"address\": \"87 W Vine St\", \"homeIns\": \"1200\", \"propTax\": \"2665\", \"defaultTab\": \"mortgage\", \"downPayment\": \"99980\", \"defaultLanguage\": \"en\"}}',1,0,'[{\"code\": \"sqft\", \"label\": \"Square feet is 3,014 sq ft, wanted 3,500 sq ft or more\", \"short\": \"486 sq ft short\"}]','undecided',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-01 01:21:00','2026-08-29 23:18:28','2026-09-01 01:22:53',NULL,'2026-08-29 23:18:28','2026-09-01 01:22:53'),
	(2,'2164275','https://www.utahrealestate.com/2164275','425 W Cherry St',NULL,'Grantsville','UT','84029',NULL,40.5951732,-112.4779408,'exact',509900,0,NULL,3770,4,3.0,3084,'{\"Floor 1\":1542,\"Basement 1\":1542}',0.3500,2,100,'Single Family','Rambler/Ranch',NULL,1993,'ACTIVE',62,0,NULL,NULL,'Spacious and fully finished home offering an incredible amount of living space both inside and out! Situated in a great location with beautiful panoramic views and a quiet neighborhood setting, this property features an open-concept kitchen and dining area perfect for entertaining. The fully finished basement includes a mother-in-law apartment, providing excellent income potential. Recent updates include a new water heater, furnace, roof, and kitchen appliances. Additional improvements include cleaned air ducts, added attic insulation, and a recently serviced A/C unit. Enjoy the enclosed screened porch, ample exterior storage, mature shade trees, and RV parking with hookups and an RV dump station. A pellet stove in the basement adds warmth and comfort during cooler months. The upstairs washer and dryer are included with the sale; the downstairs washer and dryer are excluded. This well-maintained property offers space, flexibility, and stunning views-an opportunity you won\'t want to miss!','[\"Basement Apartment\", \"Bath: Primary\", \"Closet: Walk-In\", \"Dishwasher, Built-In\", \"Disposal\", \"French Doors\", \"Gas Log\", \"Great Room\", \"Kitchen: Second\", \"Kitchen: Updated\", \"Mother-in-Law Apt.\", \"Range/Oven: Free Stdng.\", \"Vaulted Ceilings\", \"Instantaneous Hot Water\", \"Granite Countertops\", \"Video Door Bell(s)\", \"Smart Thermostat(s)\", \"Floor Coverings: Carpet; Hardwood; Laminate; Tile\", \"Window Coverings: Blinds; Full\", \"Air Conditioning: Central Air; Electric\", \"Heating: Forced Air; Gas: Central; >= 95% efficiency\", \"Basement: (100% finished) Entrance; Full\"]','[\"Exterior: Basement Entrance; Bay Box Windows; Double Pane Windows; Greenhouse Windo