	(14,'2167377','https://www.utahrealestate.com/2167377','171 S Mustang Rd',NULL,'Grantsville','UT','84029',NULL,40.5982079,-112.4355720,'exact',589000,0,NULL,3191,5,3.0,3081,'{\"Floor 1\":1532,\"Basement 1\":1549}',0.2800,3,95,'Single Family','Rambler/Ranch',NULL,2020,'ACCEPTING BACKUP OFFERS',69,0,NULL,NULL,'WOW! Spacious fully finished home in a quiet neighborhood. This home has it all! Open floor plan, 5 large bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, main floor laundry, covered patio and fully fenced yard. Large 3 car garage with RV parking--plenty of space to park the toys! All figures per county records, buyer to verify.','[\"Bath: Primary\", \"Closet: Walk-In\", \"Dishwasher, Built-In\", \"Disposal\", \"French Doors\", \"Gas Log\", \"Great Room\", \"Range: Gas\", \"Range/Oven: Free Stdng.\", \"Vaulted Ceilings\", \"Instantaneous Hot Water\", \"Granite Countertops\", \"Floor Coverings: Carpet; Vinyl (LVP)\", \"Window Coverings: Plantation Shutters\", \"Air Conditioning: Central Air; Electric; Natural Ventilation\", \"Heating: Forced Air; Gas: Central\", \"Basement: (95% finished) Full\"]','[\"Exterior: Bay Box Windows; Double Pane Windows; Outdoor Lighting; Patio: Covered; Porch: Open; Secured Parking\", \"Lot: Curb & Gutter; Fenced: Full; Road: Paved; Sidewalks; Sprinkler: Auto-Full; Terrain, Flat; View: Mountain\", \"Landscape:\", \"Roof: Asphalt Shingles\", \"Exterior: Stone; Stucco\", \"Patio/Deck: 1 Patio\", \"Garage/Parking: Attached; Opener; RV Parking; Extra Length\", \"Garage Capacity: 3\"]','[\"Amenities: Cable TV Available; Cable TV Wired; Electric Dryer Hookup\", \"Utilities: Gas: Connected; Power: Connected; Sewer: Connected; Sewer: Public; Water: Connected\", \"Water: Culinary\"]','{\"Elementary School\":\"Willow\",\"Middle School\":\"Grantsville\",\"High School\":\"Grantsville\",\"School District\":\"Tooele\"}','Lindsey Andrus','801-360-2734','South Rim Realty 762 East 100 North Payson, UT 84651','https://assets.utahrealestate.com/photos/640x480/2167377_cb8d7def2646dffe115b665749356653_6a3b12f721f6f.jpg',41,'{\"facts\": {\"MLS#\": \"2167377\", \"Type\": \"Single Family\", \"Style\": \"Rambler/Ranch\", \"Status\": \"ACCEPTING BACKUP OFFERS\", \"Year Built\": \"2020\", \"Days on URE\": \"69\"}, \"sizes\": {\"total\": 3081, \"levels\": {\"Floor 1\": 1532, \"Basement 1\": 1549}}, \"widget\": {\"hoa\": \"0\", \"pid\": \"53124\", \"zip\": \"84029\", \"beds\": \"3.00\", \"city\": \"Grantsville\", \"baths\": \"5\", \"price\": \"589000\", \"state\": \"UT\", \"locale\": \"US\", \"address\": \"171 S Mustang Rd\", \"homeIns\": \"1200\", \"propTax\": \"3191\", \"defaultTab\": \"mortgage\", \"downPayment\": \"117800\", \"defaultLanguage\": \"en\"}}',1,0,'[{\"code\": \"sqft\", \"label\": \"Square feet is 3,081 sq ft, wanted 3,500 sq ft or more\", \"short\": \"419 sq ft short\"}]','undecided',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-01 01:21:16','2026-08-29 23:18:28','2026-09-01 01:22:53',NULL,'2026-08-29 23:18:28','2026-09-01 01:22:53'),
	(15,'2163479','https://www.utahrealestate.com/2163479','377 W Rigdon St',NULL,'Grantsville','UT','84029',NULL,40.5798700,-112.4763308,'street',589900,0,NULL,4010,3,2.0,3226,'{\"Floor 1\":1500,\"Basement 1\":1726}',0.4300,4,0,'Single Family','Rambler/Ranch',NULL,2024,'ACTIVE',86,0,NULL,NULL,'WOW! This Home. This Community. These Views. Welcome to a beautifully designed home that perfectly blends modern comfort with small-town charm. Sitting on .42 acres and showcasing calming designer colors and high-end finishes throughout, this home creates an inviting atmosphere from the moment you arrive. The welcoming entry features a built-in bench with custom shelving, offering both style and functionality. The main floor and basement boast impressive 9-foot ceilings, while vaulted ceilings in the family room and kitchen enhance the home\'s spacious, open feel. The primary suite features an elegant tray ceiling with crown molding, a dual-sink vanity, and a stunning tiled tub surround. Recessed lighting throughout the home adds warmth and sophistication. The beautifully appointed kitchen is designed to impress, featuring extra-tall cabinetry with crown molding, elegant satin-finish granite countertops, and a full-height tile backsplash extending to the ceiling. A custom molding accent wall in the family room adds character and architectural charm. Every bedroom includes large custom closets with double-hang storage and built-in shelving, maximizing organization and convenience. The insulated and finished 4-car garage includes detailed base and casing trim and provides convenient access to the ADU/basement entrance. Oversized basement windows flood the lower level with natural light, creating a bright and welcoming living space. Additional storage beneath the front porch includes the shelving units. An HVAC-integrated scent diffuser provides whole-home fragrance, adding a unique touch of luxury. Outside, the fully fenced backyard offers exceptional functionality and future potential. Features include double-gate RV access, an additional pedestrian gate, a gravel drive, full-width curb cut, and soft ambient lighting integrated throughout the fencing. Located in the rapidly growing community of Grantsville, you\'ll enjoy the perfect balance of progress and rural charm. Exciting new developments, including a new Solberg\'s Market and an upcoming shopping center, are bringing added convenience and long-term value to the area. Scenic Slopes Park is an upcoming major community park to serve the city\'s growth. Outdoor enthusiasts will love the close proximity to the Stansbury Mountains, Great Salt Lake, ATV trails, camping, hunting, fishing destinations, and the world-famous Bonneville Salt Flats. This is more than a home-it\'s a lifestyle.','[\"Bath: Primary\", \"Bath: Sep. Tub/Shower\", \"Closet: Walk-In\", \"Dishwasher, Built-In\", \"Disposal\", \"Oven: Gas\", \"Vaulted Ceilings\", \"Granite Countertops\", \"Floor Coverings: Carpet; Tile; Vinyl (LVP)\", \"Air Conditioning: Central Air; Electric\", \"Heating: Forced Air; Gas: Central\", \"Basement: (0% finished) Entrance; Full\"]','[\"Exterior: Basement Entrance; Double Pane Windows; Porch: Open; Walkout; Patio: Open\", \"Lot: Curb & Gutter; Fenced: Full; Road: Paved; Sidewalks; Terrain, Flat; View: Mountain\", \"Landscape:\", \"Roof: Asphalt Shingles\", \"Exterior: Stone; Stucco\", \"Patio/Deck: 1 Patio\", \"Garage/Parking: Attached; Opener\", \"Garage Capacity: 4\"]','[\"Amenities: Electric Dryer Hookup\", \"Utilities: Gas: Connected; Power: Connected; Sewer: Connected; Water: Connected\", \"Water: Culinary\"]','{\"Elementary School\":\"Willow\",\"Middle School\":\"Grantsville\",\"High School\":\"Grantsville\",\"School District\":\"Tooele\"}','Dawnee M. Johnston','801-809-6797','Homeview Properties Inc 3650 South Augusta View Cove Salt Lake City , UT 84044','https://assets.utahrealestate.com/photos/640x480/2163479_76d72bb45c074bee728e01284ac3981b_6a244bb99d18f.jpg',44,'{\"facts\": {\"MLS#\"