	(23,'2170034','https://www.utahrealestate.com/2170034','136 Harvest Ln',NULL,'Grantsville','UT','84029',NULL,40.5684381,-112.4590962,'exact',615000,90,'$90/Monthly • HOA Rental Cap: No',2951,4,4.0,3199,'{\"Floor 2\":791,\"Floor 1\":1204,\"Basement 1\":1204}',0.4900,NULL,80,'Single Family','2-Story',NULL,2006,'ACTIVE',55,0,NULL,NULL,'Exceptional 4-bedroom, 3.5-bath residence situated on a beautifully maintained ½-acre lot, offering an outstanding combination of timeless character, modern upgrades, and thoughtfully designed indoor and outdoor living spaces. This beautifully updated home features an inviting floor plan enhanced by elegant two-tone paint, abundant natural light, and quality finishes throughout. A dedicated office/library provides the perfect space for working from home, studying, or enjoying a quiet retreat. The finished basement offers exceptional flexibility for additional living space, a recreation room, home theater, fitness area, or guest accommodations. Major mechanical updates include a brand-new high-efficiency furnace and central air conditioning system, providing comfort, efficiency, and peace of mind for years to come. The outdoor living space is equally impressive and designed for both entertaining and recreation. Enjoy evenings around the built-in gas fire pit on the expansive patio, perfect your swing in the private batting cage, challenge friends and family on the dedicated concrete basketball sport court, or enjoy the convenience and safety of the in-ground trampoline. The expansive ½-acre lot provides plenty of room to relax, play, and entertain. This property also includes valuable irrigation water shares along with a convenient irrigation-to-culinary water valve system, allowing you to easily switch between irrigation and culinary water for outdoor watering-an added feature that helps maximize efficiency and reduce watering costs. The attached 2-car garage ensures your vehicles will stay out of the winter weather. Offering an excepti