	(24,'2156392','https://www.utahrealestate.com/2156392','444 S Saddle Rd',NULL,'Grantsville','UT','84029',NULL,40.5880083,-112.4251405,'street',619000,20,'$240/Annually • HOA Change Fee: $0 • HOA Rental Cap: No • Playground',3300,6,3.0,3125,'{\"Floor 1\":1619,\"Basement 1\":1506}',0.5500,2,97,'Single Family','Rambler/Ranch',NULL,2012,'ACTIVE',116,0,NULL,NULL,'Imagine starting your day on the inviting front porch, sipping your morning beverage while soaking in breathtaking mountain views. Step inside this beautifully maintained 6-bedroom, 3-bath rambler and discover an expansive, light-filled home perfect for modern living and effortless entertaining. The open-concept main floor features soaring vaulted ceilings, a spacious great room anchored by a cozy fireplace, and a cook\'s kitchen ideal for family gatherings. Retreat to the primary suite with its generous walk-in closet and bathroom complete with a deep soaking tub and separate shower. Downstairs, the fully finished basement offers additional flexibility with a large great room, three bedrooms, a full bathroom, and abundant storage. Outside, the expansive fully fenced backyard is an entertainer\'s dream - plenty of room for gardening, play, or simply relaxing in the peaceful setting. There\'s also ample space for RV parking, making this the perfect home for hobbies and adventure. To top it off this home includes Solar panels which are paid for.','[\"Bath: Primary\", \"Bath: Sep. Tub/Shower\", \"Closet: Walk-In\", \"Dishwasher, Built-In\", \"Disposal\", \"Gas Log\", \"Great Room\", \"Range: Gas\", \"Range/Oven: Free Stdng.\", \"Floor Coverings: Carpet; Laminate; Tile\", \"Window Coverings: Blinds; Part\", \"Air Conditioning: Central Air; Electric\", \"Heating: Forced Air\", \"Basement: (97% finished) Full\"]','[\"Exterior: Double Pane Windows; Sliding Glass Doors; Patio: Open\", \"Lot: Curb & Gutter; Fenced: Part; Sprinkler: Auto-Full; Terrain, Flat; View: Mountain\", \"Landscape: Landscaping: Part; Mature Trees\