	(31,'2152520','https://www.utahrealestate.com/2152520','796 W Cherry Orchard Ln',NULL,'Grantsville','UT','84029',NULL,40.5931528,-112.4897010,'street',641000,0,NULL,3566,4,3.0,3550,'{\"Floor 1\":1775,\"Basement 1\":1775}',0.5000,4,30,'Single Family','Rambler/Ranch',NULL,2022,'ACTIVE',131,0,NULL,NULL,'2022 Rambler on the Southwest part of Grantsville. Beautiful view of the mountains and valley. This is a very quiet, peaceful, and friendly neighborhood. Grantsville is an excellent community to raise a family. New extended concrete driveway, new concrete back patio (70x18), new hot tub (nice to relax in after work), new sprinkling system, and sod. Barbecue pit in the back. New bedroom, bathroom, and hallway, and new shelving in the furnace room, and shelving for food storage in the basement. New shelving in the garage. Tankless water heater saves a lot on gas and electric bill. Only a couple miles away from the Grantsville reservoir, for great fishing, camping, ATVs, and just relaxing in the great outdoors. 10 minutes away from I-80, and 30 minutes away from the SLC airport. Very large backyard for a huge, detached garage, sports court, pickleball court, etc. Seller financing terms are purchase price to be $690,000, at least $50,000 down, and no longer than one year.','[\"Bath: Primary\", \"Bath: Sep. Tub/Shower\", \"Closet: Walk-In\", \"Dishwasher, Built-In\", \"Disposal\", \"Gas Log\", \"Range/Oven: Built-In\", \"Vaulted Ceilings\", \"Floor Coverings: Carpet; Laminate; Vinyl (LVP)\", \"Window Coverings: Blinds\", \"Air Conditioning: Central Air; Electric\", \"Heating: Forced Air; Gas: Central\", \"Basement: (30% finished) Full\"]','[\"Exterior: Double Pane Windows; Outdoor Lighting; Sliding Glass Doors\", \"Lot: Curb & Gutter; Fenced: Full; Sidewalks; Sprinkler: Auto-Full; Terrain: Grad Slope; View: Lake; View: Mountain; View: Valley\", \"Landscape: Landscaping: Part\", \"Roof: Asphalt Shingles\", \"Exterior: Asphalt Shingles; Stone; Stucco\", \"Garage/Parking: Atta