	(32,'2173351','https://www.utahrealestate.com/2173351','520 S Cheney Ave',NULL,'Grantsville','UT','84029',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,647000,18,'$210/Annually • HOA Rental Cap: No',1,3,3.0,3751,'{\"Floor 1\":1895,\"Basement 1\":1856}',0.2900,3,0,'Single Family','Rambler/Ranch','Under Construction',2026,'ACTIVE',41,1,NULL,'Listed as \"Under Construction\" with no completion date given.','This beautifully designed 1825 Farmhouse home offers the perfect blend of timeless style and modern comfort. The spacious kitchen is a standout feature, showcasing elegant gray laminate cabinetry, stunning quartz countertops, premium platinum gas appliances, and a stylish tile backsplash. A charming box window in the kitchen nook creates the perfect space to enjoy morning coffee while bringing in abundant natural light. Throughout the home, you\'ll find durable laminate hardwood, vinyl tile, and plush carpet flooring complemented by Craftsman-style base and casing, extensive can lighting, and sophisticated satin and brushed nickel hardware. The inviting great room is anchored by a cozy gas log fireplace, creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere for relaxing or entertaining. The owner\'s suite offers a beautiful box window retreat and a grand ensuite bathroom featuring elegant tile surrounds. Additional upgrades include an energy-efficient tankless water heater, convenient Christmas light outlets, and a spacious 3-car garage with an exterior exit door. Designed with quality craftsmanship and thoughtful details throughout, this stunning Farmhouse home delivers exceptional style, comfort, and functionality for modern living.','[\"Bath: Primary\", \"Bath: Sep. Tub/Shower\", \"Closet: Walk-In\", \"Dishwasher, Built-In\", \"Disposal\", \"Gas Log\", \"Great Room\", \"Oven: Gas\", \"Range: Gas\", \"Quartz Countertops\", \"Floor Coverings: Carpet; Laminate; Vinyl (LVP)\", \"Air Conditioning: Central Air; Electric\", \"Heating: Forced Air; Gas: Central\", \"Basement: (0% finished) Full\"]','[\"Exteri