	(40,'2170616','https://www.utahrealestate.com/2170616','411 E Broderick Way','111','Grantsville','UT','84029',NULL,40.5915903,-112.4467764,'exact',665590,0,NULL,1,3,2.0,3542,'{\"Floor 1\":1774,\"Basement 1\":1768}',0.2800,3,0,'Single Family','Rambler/Ranch','To Be Built',2026,'ACTIVE',54,1,NULL,'Listed as \"To Be Built\" - construction has not started.','*TO BE BUILT* Welcome to The Lexus! This thoughtfully designed floor plan is ideal for those who love spacious, open gathering areas, making it perfect for entertaining or everyday living. This home showcases GTM Builders\' exceptional standard finishes, including granite countertops, knotty alder cabinetry, luxury vinyl plank (LVP) flooring, and beautifully tiled tub and shower surrounds. The luxurious European-style glass shower enclosure adds a modern, spa-like touch to the primary bathroom. The well-appointed kitchen features a stunning range hood over the induction cooktop, a built-in oven and microwave, dishwasher, and refrigerator-offering both style and functionality. The finished garage is completed with sheetrock, paint, and baseboards that seamlessly match the home\'s interior, creating a polished, cohesive look throughout. Enjoy a relaxing evening on your covered patio or your covered front porch. Front yard landscaping included. Square footage figures are provided as a courtesy estimate only and were obtained from county . Buyer is advised to obtain an independent measurement.','[\"Bath: Primary\", \"Bath: Sep. Tub/Shower\", \"Closet: Walk-In\", \"Dishwasher, Built-In\", \"Disposal\", \"Oven: Wall\", \"Range: Countertop\", \"Granite Countertops\", \"Floor Coverings: Carpet; Vinyl (LVP)\", \"Window Coverings: None\", \"Air Conditioning: Central Air; Electric\", \"Heating: Gas: Central; >= 95% efficiency\", \"Basement: (0% finished) Full\"]','[\"Exterior: Double Pane Windows; Entry (Foyer); Porch: Open; Sliding Glass Doors; Patio: Open\", \"Lot: Curb & Gutter; Fenced: Part; Road: Paved; Sidewalks; Sprink