	(41,'2169961','https://www.utahrealestate.com/2169961','122 E Box Elder Dr',NULL,'Grantsville','UT','84029',NULL,40.5648926,-112.4561912,'exact',669900,30,'$30/Monthly • HOA Rental Cap: No',4740,5,4.0,5344,'{\"Floor 2\":1212,\"Floor 1\":2072,\"Basement 1\":2060}',0.5700,2,0,'Single Family','2-Story',NULL,2006,'ACTIVE',56,0,NULL,NULL,'Tucked away in the coveted South Willow Ranches, this horse-zoned estate sits on just under 2/3 of an acre, offering the perfect blend of privacy, space, and endless potential. Fully fenced with drive-through gates and room to build a future detached garage, shop, or additional outbuildings, the property is ready to fit your lifestyle. The backyard is a true private retreat, featuring mature shade trees, a fruit orchard, berry bushes, blooming roses, winding garden pathways, redwood pergolas, a gazebo, misting system, ambient landscape lighting, and breathtaking mountain views-creating an ideal setting for entertaining or simply enjoying peaceful evenings at home. Inside, you\'ll find 5 spacious bedrooms, soaring 20-foot ceilings, and a stunning floor-to-ceiling stone fireplace that anchors the main living area, with French doors opening directly to the backyard oasis. The oversized main-level primary suite is its own sanctuary, complete with a three-sided fireplace, jetted soaking tub, dual vanities, oversized dual-head shower, and a generous walk-in closet. The home has been rehabbed with an updated kitchen, new paint, and new carpet throughout. Downstairs, the framed basement offers a blank canvas ready for future expansion and includes a hidden \"secret\" storage/safe room-perfect for food storage, emergency supplies, a secure safe room, or whatever your imagination has in mind. This is more than just a home... t\'s a rare opportunity to enjoy country-style living with room to grow, all while being close to modern conveniences.','[\"Bath: Primary\", \"Bath: Sep. Tub/Shower\", \"Closet: Walk-In\", \"Dishwasher, Built-In\", \"Disposa