	(44,'2181973','https://www.utahrealestate.com/2181973','6 Maraschino Ln',NULL,'Grantsville','UT','84029',NULL,40.5996255,-112.4895252,'exact',675000,0,NULL,192,6,4.0,3408,'{\"Floor 1\":1672,\"Basement 1\":1736}',0.5500,3,100,'Single Family','Rambler/Ranch',NULL,2021,'ACTIVE',3,0,NULL,NULL,'Step into this beautifully maintained, turn-key home designed for both effortless living and grand entertaining. Spanning 3,408 square feet, this spacious residence features five large bedrooms, four luxurious bathrooms, and two expansive family rooms. The main-level primary suite serves as a true private retreat, complete with double sinks, a walk-in closet, a separate soaking tub, and a custom tile shower. At the center of the home, the gourmet kitchen shines with granite countertops, stainless steel appliances, a double oven, and a dedicated range hood. Set on a sprawling .55-acre corner lot, the exterior features a three-car garage, dedicated RV parking, and a fully finished, fully fenced backyard equipped with automatic sprinklers for effortless outdoor enjoyment. Built in 2020 with a single owner, the home also includes a massive solar panel system with two integrated storage batteries to dramatically minimize energy costs. Modern efficiency, thoughtful upgrades, and exceptional space-welcome home!','[\"Alarm: Fire\", \"Bath: Sep. Tub/Shower\", \"Closet: Walk-In\", \"Dishwasher, Built-In\", \"Disposal\", \"Floor Drains\", \"Oven: Double\", \"Range: Countertop\", \"Range: Gas\", \"Granite Countertops\", \"Floor Coverings: Carpet; Laminate\", \"Window Coverings: Blinds\", \"Air Conditioning: Central Air; Electric; Active Solar\", \"Heating: Forced Air; Gas: Central; Active Solar\", \"Basement: (100% finished) Entrance; Full; Walkout\"]','[\"Exterior: Double Pane Windows; Entry (Foyer); Outdoor Lighting; Patio: Covered; Walkout\", \"Lot: Corner Lot; Curb & Gutter; Fenced: Full; Road: Paved; Sprinkler: Auto-Full; Terrain, Flat; View: Mountain\", \"Landscape: Landscaping: Part\", \"Roof: Asphalt Shingles\", \"Exterior: Asphalt Shingles; Stone; Stucco; Cement Board\", \"Patio/Deck: 1 Patio\", \"Garage/Parking: Attached; Opener\", \"Garage Capacity: 3\"]','[\"Amenities:\", \"Utilities: Gas: Connected; Power: Connected; Sewer: Connected; Water: Connected\", \"Water: Culinary\"]','{\"Elementary School\":\"Grantsville\",\"Middle School\":\"Grantsville\",\"High School\":\"Grantsville\",\"School District\":\"Tooele\"}','David Wiser','801-498-0862','Wiser Real Estate, LLC 10808 S River Front Parkway 290 South Jordan, UT 84095','https://assets.utahrealestate.com/photos/640x480/2181973_16255dad0133bb80350131746b48e7af_6a92095066a61.jpg',46,'{\"facts\": {\"MLS#\": \"2181973\", \"Type\": \"Single Family\", \"Style\": \"Rambler/Ranch\", \"Status\": \"ACTIVE\", \"Year Built\": \"2021\", \"Days on URE\": \"3\"}, \"sizes\": {\"total\": 3408, \"levels\": {\"Floor 1\": 1672, \"Basement 1\": 1736}}, \"widget\": {\"hoa\": \"0\", \"pid\": \"53124\", \"zip\": \"84029\", \"beds\": \"4.00\", \"city\": \"Grantsville\", \"baths\": \"6\", \"price\": \"675000\", \"state\": \"UT\", \"locale\": \"US\", \"address\": \"6  Maraschino Ln\", \"homeIns\": \"1200\", \"propTax\": \"192\", \"defaultTab\": \"mortgage\", \"downPayment\": \"135000\", \"defaultLanguage\": \"en\"}}',1,0,'[{\"code\": \"sqft\", \"label\": \"Square feet is 3,408 sq ft, wanted 3,500 sq ft or more\", \"short\": \"92 sq ft short\"}]','undecided',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-01 01:21:52','2026-08-29 23:18:28','2026-09-01 01:22:53',NULL,'2026-08-29 23:18:28','2026-09-01 01:22:53'),
	(45,'2161279','https://www.utahrealestate.com/2161279','321 S Lookout Ridge Dr',NULL,'Grantsville','UT','84029',NULL,40.5906922,-112.4419310,'exact',679000,0,NULL,3992,6,3.0,3406,'{\"Floor 1\":1683,\"Basement 1\":1723}',0.5000,3,97,'Single Family','Rambler/Ranch',NULL,2019,'ACTIVE',95,0,NULL,NULL,'For those drawn to the idea of quieter streets, larger lots, and a home that feels established from day one, this Grantsville rambler offers a lifestyle that\'s becoming increasingly difficult to find near the Salt Lake Valley. Set on a fully fenced half-acre lot with mature landscaping, producing fruit trees, paved RV parking, irrigation water share, and no HOA, the property blends comfort, functionality, flexibility, and character with plenty of room to grow. Inside, soaring vaulted ceilings in the entryway make an immediate impression, welcoming you into light-filled living spaces with warm LVP flooring, a wood beam accent, and an open-concept layout designed for everyday living and gathering alike. The kitchen serves as the heart of the home with granite countertops, an oversized island, floating shelves, and a reclaimed wood pantry door, while shiplap accents, wood paneling, custom tilework, and shutters add warmth and personality throughout. Designed for easy main-level living, the home features a private primary suite filled with natural light, main-level laundry, and six spacious bedrooms with three bathrooms total, offering flexibility for guests, hobbies, work-from-home needs, or simply room to grow. The finished basement expands the living space with a projector and screen for the perfect home theater setup, a dry bar area, and a large storage room. Outside, the fully landscaped yard, mature trees, pergola, gas firepit, and established outdoor spaces create a move-in ready experience where the work has already been done and the home can be enjoyed from day one. A French door creates an effortless connection from the main living space to the backyard, while the irrigation water share adds practicality and long-term value for maintaining the lush landscaping with ease. If you find yourself craving a little more breathing room without giving up convenience, this home offers the balance of peaceful small-town living with an easy commute back to the Salt Lake Valley, all within a property that feels established, inviting, and ready to enjoy from the moment you arrive.','[\"Bar: Dry\", \"Bath: Primary\", \"Closet: Walk-In\", \"Dishwasher, Built-In\", \"French Doors\", \"Range: Gas\", \"Granite Countertops\", \"Floor Coverings: Carpet; Tile; Vinyl (LVP)\", \"Window Coverings: Blinds; Plantation Shutters\", \"Air Conditioning: Central Air; Electric\", \"Heating: Forced Air; Gas: Central\", \"Basement: (97% finished) Full\"]','[\"Exterior: Entry (Foyer); Patio: Covered\", \"Lot: Curb & Gutter; Fenced: Full; Road: Paved; Sidewalks; View: Mountain\", \"Landscape: Fruit Trees; Landscaping: Full; Mature Trees\", \"Roof: Asphalt Shingles\", \"Exterior: Clapboard/Masonite; Stucco\", \"Patio/Deck: 1 Deck\", \"Garage/Parking: Attached; RV Parking\", \"Garage Capacity: 3\"]','[\"Amenities:\", \"Utilities: Gas: Connected; Power: Connected; Sewer: Connected; Water: Connected\", \"Water: Culinary; Irrigation; Shares\"]','{\"Elementary School\":\"Grantsville\",\"Middle School\":\"Grantsville\",\"High School\":\"Grantsville\",\"School District\":\"Tooele\"}','Catherine Davey Day','801-608-8387','Summit Sotheby\'s International Realty (Salt Lake) 1260 East Stringham Avenue Suite 100 Salt Lake City, UT 84106','https://assets.utahrealestate.com/photos/640x480/2161279_caaff0533b17a6e378c4d49fdb257e3a_6a18a65ca4770.jpg',48,'{\"facts\": {\"MLS#\": \"2161279\", \"Type\": \"Single Family\", \"Style\": \"Rambler/Ranch\", \"Status\": \"ACTIVE\", \"Year Built\": \"2019\", \"Days on URE\": \"95\"}, \"sizes\": {\"total\": 3406, \"levels\": {\"Floor 1\": 1683, \"Basement 1\": 1723}}, \"widget\": {\"hoa\": \"0\", \"pid\": \"53124\", \"zip\": \"84029\", \"beds