	(47,'2170793','https://www.utahrealestate.com/2170793','789 S Chancelor Way','113','Grantsville','UT','84029',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,697150,0,NULL,1,3,2.0,3612,'{\"Floor 1\":1826,\"Basement 1\":1786}',0.5000,3,0,'Single Family','Rambler/Ranch','To Be Built',2026,'ACTIVE',53,1,NULL,'Listed as \"To Be Built\" - construction has not started.','Introducing The Abigail, a beautifully designed home that combines timeless finishes with a functional layout you\'ll love. The open living spaces provide the perfect setting for everything from quiet evenings at home to entertaining family and friends. GTM Builders\' quality craftsmanship shines throughout with granite countertops, knotty alder cabinetry, luxury vinyl plank (LVP) flooring, and stylish tile surrounds in the tubs and showers. The primary bath features a sleek European-style glass shower enclosure, creating a clean and contemporary look. The thoughtfully designed kitchen is complete with an induction cooktop, a custom vent hood, built-in oven and microwave, dishwasher, and refrigerator, making meal preparation both convenient and enjoyable. Additional upgrades include a fully finished garage with sheetrock, paint, and matching baseboards for a seamless finish. Step outside to enjoy the covered deck, perfect for relaxing or outdoor dining, while the included front yard landscaping provides beautiful curb appeal from day one. Square footage figures are provided as a courtesy estimate only and were obtained from builder plans . Buyer is advised to obtain an independent measurement.','[\"Bath: Primary\", \"Bath: Sep. Tub/Shower\", \"Closet: Walk-In\", \"Den/Office\", \"Dishwasher, Built-In\", \"Disposal\", \"French Doors\", \"Oven: Wall\", \"Range: Countertop\", \"Vaulted Ceilings\", \"Granite Countertops\", \"Floor Coverings: Carpet; Vinyl (LVP)\", \"Window Coverings: None\", \"Air Conditioning: Central Air; Gas\", \"Heating: Gas: Central; >= 95% efficiency\", \"Basement: (0% finished) Full\"]','[\"Exterior: Double Pane