	(49,'2146135','https://www.utahrealestate.com/2146135','635 S Chan Dr',NULL,'Grantsville','UT','84029',NULL,40.5802201,-112.4342610,'exact',699900,25,'$25/Monthly • HOA Rental Cap: No',5025,4,5.0,4790,'{\"Floor 1\":2380,\"Basement 1\":2410}',0.5000,3,80,'Single Family','Rambler/Ranch',NULL,2022,'ACTIVE',156,0,NULL,NULL,'Built in 2022 on a premium half-acre lot, this 4,790 square foot residence offers all the benefits of a brand-new home, but with the massive added value of an already finished basement and completed landscaping, making it an incredible value compared to new construction. Featuring four bedrooms and four and a half bathrooms, you get total turnkey peace of mind with window blinds installed throughout, an operational radon mitigation system, and a gourmet kitchen equipped with double ovens, an open-concept layout, and an included stainless steel refrigerator. The finished lower level expands your functional footprint with a large family room ideal for a home theater, gym, or guest quarters. Outside, enjoy scenic mountain views, raised garden beds, and eight mature fruit trees including three cherry, two nectaplum, two peach, and one almond tree. Utility and outdoor flexibility are maximized with one included irrigation share for low-cost watering, along with a large graveled parking area perfect for an RV, boat, or future detached workshop. Situated in a quiet Grantsville neighborhood, this home offers phenomenal proximity to local schools at just 0.3 miles from Twenty Wells Elementary and minutes from Grantsville High School, while placing you moments from Grantsville Reservoir and the Clark Historic Farm, all with an easy 35-minute commute to Salt Lake International Airport and downtown Salt Lake City.','[\"Bath: Primary\", \"Closet: Walk-In\", \"Den/Office\", \"Dishwasher, Built-In\", \"Disposal\", \"Great Room\", \"Oven: Double\", \"Range: Gas\", \"Range/Oven: Built-In\", \"Floor Coverings: Carpet; Laminate; Tile; Vinyl\", \"Window Coverings: Blin