	(51,'2170494','https://www.utahrealestate.com/2170494','729 S Chancelor Way','112','Grantsville','UT','84029',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,717500,0,NULL,1,3,3.0,3771,'{\"Floor 1\":1900,\"Basement 1\":1871}',0.5000,3,0,'Single Family','Rambler/Ranch','To Be Built',2026,'ACTIVE',54,1,NULL,'Listed as \"To Be Built\" - construction has not started.','To Be Built. Welcome to the McKenna floor plan by GTM Builders, located in a beautiful Grantsville community. This thoughtfully designed home offers modern style and exceptional craftsmanship with an open-concept layout perfect for everyday living and entertaining. Features include LVP flooring throughout the main living areas, a gourmet kitchen with a built-in oven, cooktop, custom cabinetry, and included refrigerator. The luxurious primary suite features a tiled shower with a Euro glass enclosure for a spa-like retreat. Enjoy quality finishes, timeless design, and the opportunity to build your dream home. Builder offering up to a $24,000 seller incentive when using the preferred lender. Square footage figures are provided as a courtesy estimate only and were obtained from Builder Plans. Buyer is advised to obtain an independent measurement.','[\"Alarm: Fire\", \"Bath: Primary\", \"Closet: Walk-In\", \"Den/Office\", \"Dishwasher, Built-In\", \"Disposal\", \"Vaulted Ceilings\", \"Granite Countertops\", \"Quartz Countertops\", \"Floor Coverings: Carpet; Vinyl (LVP)\", \"Window Coverings: None\", \"Air Conditioning: Central Air; Electric\", \"Heating: Gas: Central; >= 95% efficiency\", \"Basement: (0% finished) Full\"]','[\"Exterior: Deck; Covered; Double Pane Windows; Porch: Open; Sliding Glass Doors\", \"Lot: Curb & Gutter; Fenced: Part; Sidewalks; Sprinkler: Auto-Part; Terrain, Flat; Terrain: Mountain; View: Mountain\", \"Landscape: Landscaping: Part\", \"Roof: Asphalt Shingles\", \"Exterior: Stone; Stucco; Cement Board\", \"Garage/Parking: Attached\", \"Garage Capacity: 3\"]','[\"Amenities: Home Warranty\", \"Utilities: Gas: Conn