	(63,'2170631','https://www.utahrealestate.com/2170631','727 S Chancelor Way','106','Grantsville','UT','84029',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,790540,0,NULL,1,4,3.0,4465,'{\"Floor 2\":886,\"Floor 1\":1821,\"Basement 1\":1758}',0.5100,3,0,'Single Family','2-Story','To Be Built',2026,'ACTIVE',54,1,NULL,'Listed as \"To Be Built\" - construction has not started.','*TO BE BUILT* Welcome to The Leah, a beautifully crafted home designed with comfort, style, and functionality in mind. Its open-concept layout creates an inviting space for hosting family and friends or simply enjoying everyday living. Built with GTM Builders\' signature quality, this home features granite countertops, knotty alder cabinetry, luxury vinyl plank (LVP) flooring, and elegant tile surrounds in the bathrooms. The primary suite is enhanced by a sleek European-style glass shower enclosure, adding a sophisticated, spa-inspired feel. The kitchen is equipped with premium appliances, including an induction cooktop with a decorative vent hood, built-in oven and microwave, dishwasher, and includes a refrigerator, offering a perfect blend of convenience and modern design. The finished garage includes sheetrock, paint, and matching baseboards for a clean, finished appearance that complements the rest of the home. Step outside to the covered deck, an ideal spot to unwind or entertain, while the professionally landscaped front yard adds to the home\'s outstanding curb appeal. Square footage figures are provided as a courtesy estimate only and were obtained from builder plans . Buyer is advised to obtain an independent measurement.','[\"Bath: Primary\", \"Bath: Sep. Tub/Shower\", \"Closet: Walk-In\", \"Den/Office\", \"Dishwasher, Built-In\", \"Disposal\", \"Oven: Wall\", \"Range: Countertop\", \"Vaulted Ceilings\", \"Floor Coverings: Carpet; Vinyl (LVP)\", \"Window Coverings: None\", \"Air Conditioning: Central Air; Electric\", \"Heating: Gas: Central; >= 95% efficiency\", \"Basement: (0% finished) Full\"]','[\"Exterior: D