	(64,'2163004','https://www.utahrealestate.com/2163004','345 E Dutton Ct','112','Grantsville','UT','84029',NULL,40.5871180,-112.4502605,'exact',799000,0,NULL,1,4,3.0,4465,'{\"Floor 2\":886,\"Floor 1\":1821,\"Basement 1\":1758}',0.5000,3,0,'Single Family','2-Story','Under Construction',2026,'ACTIVE',88,1,'2027-07-31','Ide flexible living for work, play, or relaxation. Under construction and estimated to be completed in July, opportunities like this don\'t last. Thoughtful design, elevated finishes, and incredible','Don\'t miss your chance to own The Leah, now with a fresh, modern look and a $24,000 seller incentive. This beautifully designed two story home features an open concept layout, a gourmet kitchen with built in wall oven and microwave, 30\" induction cooktop, custom wood hood, knotty alder cabinetry, and an included refrigerator. The main level primary suite offers a private retreat with an en‑suite bath and walk in closet. Upstairs, three bedrooms and a spacious loft provide flexible living for work, play, or relaxation. Under construction and estimated to be completed in July, opportunities like this don\'t last. Thoughtful design, elevated finishes, and incredible incentives make The Leah a standout you\'ll want to secure quickly.','[\"Bath: Primary\", \"Bath: Sep. Tub/Shower\", \"Closet: Walk-In\", \"Den/Office\", \"Dishwasher, Built-In\", \"Disposal\", \"Oven: Wall\", \"Range: Countertop\", \"Floor Coverings: Carpet; Vinyl (LVP)\", \"Window Coverings: None\", \"Air Conditioning: Central Air; Electric\", \"Heating: Gas: Central; >= 95% efficiency\", \"Basement: (0% finished) Full\"]','[\"Exterior: Deck; Covered; Double Pane Windows; Patio: Covered\", \"Lot: Cul-de-Sac; Curb & Gutter; Fenced: Part; Road: Paved; Sidewalks; Sprinkler: Auto-Part; Terrain, Flat; View: Mountain\", \"Landscape: Landscaping: Part\", \"Roof: Asphalt Shingles\", \"Exterior: Stone; Stucco\", \"Garage/Parking: Attached; Opener\", \"Garage Capacity: 3\"]','[\"Amenities:\", \"Utilitie