	(65,'2177566','https://www.utahrealestate.com/2177566','395 Premier Ln',NULL,'Grantsville','UT','84029',NULL,40.5702972,-112.4458205,'exact',799500,40,'$120/Quarterly • HOA Rental Cap: No • Biking Trails; Hiking Trails; Horse Trails; Pets Permitted; Picnic Area; Playground',4103,6,4.0,3873,'{\"Floor 2\":724,\"Floor 1\":1469,\"Basement 1\":1680}',0.9000,2,100,'Single Family','2-Story',NULL,2002,'ACTIVE',4,0,NULL,NULL,'HORSE PROPERTY WITH RV PARKING AND WATER SHARES! Welcome to 395 Premier Ln, a rare Grantsville gem where space, comfort, and country living come together in perfect harmony. This sprawling 6-bedroom, 3.5-bathroom home offers 3,873 square feet of thoughtfully designed living space, anchored by a convenient first-floor primary suite that makes everyday living effortless. Modern updates blend seamlessly with practical touches throughout. A newer HVAC system keeps every season comfortable, while two water heaters and generous cold storage ensure this home is built for a busy household. Downstairs, ample room invites relaxation, gatherings, and room to grow. Step outside and the possibilities truly bloom. A beautiful, oversized garden sets the stage for weekend afternoons, complemented by an 11\' x 16\' shed and an expansive 34\' x 47\' concrete pad. Adventurers will love the 80-foot RV parking, offering endless flexibility for your favorite pursuits. Best of all, this is a genuine horse property-no permits required--complete with grandfathered animal rights, direct gate-access to the horse trail, and 1.6 water shares. Whether you dream of morning rides or simply crave elbow room, this RR-1 zoned property delivers. Location seals the deal. You\'re just moments from Grantsville City Hollywood Park, with Grantsville High School and Soelberg\'s Market within easy reach. Enjoy small-town charm without sacrificing everyday convenience. Homes offering this blend of size, updates, and true equestrian freedom rarely come to market. Come experience the lifestyle 395 Premier Ln was made to provide. Your Grantsville sanctuary awaits. Square footage figures are provided as a courtesy estimate only and were obtained from an Appraisal. Buyer is advised to obtain an independent measurement.','[\"Alarm: Fire\", \"Alarm: Security\", \"Basement Apartment\", \"Bath: Primary\", \"Bath: Sep. Tub/Shower\", \"Closet: Walk-In\", \"Dishwasher, Built-In\", \"Disposal\", \"Floor Drains\", \"French Doors\", \"Great Room\", \"Kitchen: Second\", \"Mother-in-Law Apt.\", \"Range: Countertop\", \"Range/Oven: Built-In\", \"Vaulted Ceilings\", \"Theater Room\", \"Floor Coverings: Carpet; Laminate; Tile\", \"Window Coverings: Blinds; Draperies; Plantation Shutters\", \"Air Conditioning: Central Air; Electric; Heat Pump\", \"Heating: Gas: Central; Heat Pump\", \"Basement: (100% finished) Entrance\"]','[\"Exterior: Awnings; Basement Entrance; Deck; Covered; Double Pane Windows; Out Buildings; Patio: Covered\", \"Lot: Corner Lot; Fenced: Full; Road: Paved; Secluded Yard; Sprinkler: Auto-Full; Terrain, Flat; Drip Irrigation: Auto-Full\", \"Landscape: Landscaping: Part; Mature Trees; Pines; Vegetable Garden\", \"Roof: Asphalt Shingles\", \"Exterior: Asphalt Shingles; Stucco\", \"Patio/Deck: 1 Patio 1 Deck\", \"Garage/Parking: Attached; Extra Height; Opener; Parking: Uncovered\", \"Garage Capacity: 2\"]','[\"Amenities: Cable TV Available; Cable TV Wired; Home Warranty; Park/Playground\", \"Utilities: Gas: Connected; Power: Connected; Sewer: Connected; Water: Connected\", \"Water: Culinary; Irrigation: Pressure; Rights: Owned; Shares\"]','{\"Elementary School\":\"Willow\",\"Middle School\":\"Grantsville\",\"High School\":\"Grantsville\",\"School District\":\"Tooele\"}','Scott G. Myler','801-427-1110','Signature Group Real Estate 7650 S Union Park Avenue Midvale, UT 84047','https://assets.utahrealestate.com/photos/640x480/2177566_bea52f4317247dd53037969148fbe206_6a7743dbbd7b5.jpg',71,'{\"facts\": {\"MLS#\": \"2177566\", \"Type\": \"Single Family\", \"Style\": \